OL,3,GNEWSACornish communities urged to
OL,4,Aprepare for emergency
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities in Cornwall are being
OL,7,Fencouraged to work together to draw up
OL,8,Femergency plans.
OL,10,FCornwall Council's cabinet member for
OL,11,Fcommunity safety, Thalia Marrington,
OL,12,Fsaid it was important all towns and
OL,13,Fparishes were prepared for risks around
OL,14,Fweather and connectivity.
OL,16,FIt comes as the government has launched
OL,17,Fa national public awareness campaign to
OL,18,Fhelp households prepare for extreme
OL,19,Fweather and everyday emergencies.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
