OL,3,GNEWSACornish communities urged to
OL,4,Aprepare for emergency
OL,5,
OL,6,FA study by the National Association of
OL,7,FLocal Councils (NALC) found nationally
OL,8,Ffewer than half of parish and town
OL,9,Fcouncils had a formal emergency plan,
OL,10,Fand nearly a third had none at all.
